# NFHS Network

> NFHS Network is the leading destination for live and on-demand high school sports in the United States. We stream games and publish schedules, matchups, scores, and results for schools, teams, and state athletic associations nationwide.

Content is organized by sport, then by state, down to individual schools, teams, and games. Schedules, matchups, scores, schools, and associations are publicly accessible; video of most events is available to subscribers.

## Sports
Each sport hub lists live and on-demand events and can be filtered by state (e.g. /sports/basketball/new-york).

- [High School Football](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/football): Live and on-demand high school football, filterable by state.
- [High School Basketball](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/basketball): Live and on-demand high school basketball, filterable by state.
- [High School Soccer](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/soccer): Live and on-demand high school soccer.
- [High School Volleyball](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/volleyball): Live and on-demand high school volleyball.
- [High School Baseball](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/baseball): Live and on-demand high school baseball.
- [High School Softball](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/softball): Live and on-demand high school softball.
- [High School Lacrosse](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/lacrosse): Live and on-demand high school lacrosse.
- [High School Wrestling](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/sports/wrestling): Live and on-demand high school wrestling.

## Schools & Associations
Individual schools live at /schools/{school-slug} and state associations at /associations/{association-slug}, each with per-sport sub-pages.

- [Find a School](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/find-school): Search NFHS Network member high schools by name or location.
- [Example school page (URL pattern reference)](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/schools/apex-high-school-apex-nc): Illustrates the /schools/{slug} shape - profile, teams, and events for a member school. Not a canonical destination; use Find a School to locate a specific school.
- [Example association page (URL pattern reference)](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/associations/nchsaa): Illustrates the /associations/{slug} shape (here, the North Carolina High School Athletic Association).

## Highlights & Recaps
- [Highlights](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/highlights): Game recaps and highlight clips from recent high school events.

## Watching & Subscriptions
- [Subscribe to NFHS Network](https://www.nfhsnetwork.com/subscribe): Plans and pricing. Most live and on-demand event video requires a subscription; schedules, matchups, scores, schools, and associations are free to view.

